    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Three media startups have graduated from the Innovators-in-Residence program by The Aga Khan University Graduate School of Media and Communications' Media Innovation Centre (MiC). The second cohort pitched their ideas in a 'demo day' at the Media Challenge Initiative Hub in Uganda.",
